Apply the exact gate to DiagnosticTask: Diagnostic outcomes discriminate hypotheses and do not introduce unlearned prerequisites. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
